Description: Subscription-based proxy balancer with system tray control
 Subrelay fetches VLESS subscription nodes, builds sing-box
 configurations, and exposes per-node and balancer SOCKS5/HTTP
 inbounds on localhost. The application runs as a system tray
 icon with settings, nodes, and log viewer windows.
